# Very simple test of new scoring system

Geometry Mesh
   Name MyMesh                    ! geometry type
    X -10.5  10.5    1
    Y -10.5  10.5    1
    Z  0.0  10.0   200

Output
         Filename NB_msh.bdo
         Geo MyMesh
         Quantity Energy
         Quantity Fluence
         Quantity Dose
         Quantity DirtyDose
         Quantity DoseGy
         Quantity DirtyDoseGy
         Quantity DLET
